# note: Eight partitions declared in a frame with only ten bytes left for the
#   twenty-one-byte size table.
# expect: reject
# exercises: The "size < 3 * last_part" test in ParsePartitions(), the one
#   failure there that cannot be papered over: the sizes themselves are
#   unreadable, so there is nothing to clamp. Confirmed to reach
#   parts_size_table_truncated and no further.
width 16
height 16
log2_nbr_of_DCT_partitions 3  # 8 partitions
macroblock
intra_y_mode DC_PRED
intra_chroma_mode DC_PRED
patch truncate tokens 10
